      <div class="p-copy">
        <div class="p-pillar-n">Pillar 01</div>

        <h3 class="p-name" style="color: #00a86b;">
          Vitality
        </h3>

        <p class="p-body">Cell renewal. The foundation of everything else. Without consistent renewal, nothing that's applied to the surface reaches the cells that need it.</p>

        <p class="p-mechanism">Sun-safe bio-retinoids accelerate the renewal cycle without stripping the barrier. Active day and night, no sun restriction.</p>

        <div class="p-stat" data-value="+38%" style="color: #00a86b;">
  0<sup>*</sup>
</div>

        <div class="p-stat-label">Cell Proliferation · At 48 Hours</div>

        
          <div class="p-cite">* In Vitro Study Conducted to Test Effect of Bio-Retinoids on Human Dermal Fibroblasts.</div>
        
      </div>

      
    </div>
  
    <div class="pillar lg dark">
      

      <div class="p-copy">
        <div class="p-pillar-n">Pillar 02</div>

        <h3 class="p-name" style="color: #fffffff2;">
          Recovery
        </h3>

        <p class="p-body">Skin is always healing something. A breakout, a barrier stripped by actives, the small daily damage you never notice. Recovery is how fast skin closes those gaps and repairs itself before they show.</p>

        <p class="p-mechanism">The serum speeds up how quickly cells move in to close a wound. Faster migration means less time spent visibly healing, and damage that resolves before it leaves a mark.</p>

        <div class="p-stat" data-value="+74.7%" style="color: #fffffff2;">
  0<sup>*</sup>
</div>

        <div class="p-stat-label">Cell Migration · In 24 Hours</div>

        
          <div class="p-cite">* Wound Healing in Normal Human Dermal Fibroblast using Scratch Assay for SKIN LONGEVITY SYSTEM 5.</div>
        
      </div>

      
