        <div class="p-pillar-n">Pillar 03</div>

        <h3 class="p-name" style="color: #b87330;">
          Structure
        </h3>

        <p class="p-body">Collagen. The protein that makes skin bounce back. Production declines from 25 onwards. A peptide complex signals the biology to support what's slowing.</p>

        <p class="p-mechanism">Each peptide targets a specific biological function: synthesis, repair, inflammation control, moisture signalling. Simultaneously. Because the signals are interconnected.</p>

        <div class="p-stat" data-value="+132.4%" style="color: #b87330;">
  0<sup>*</sup>
</div>

        <div class="p-stat-label">Collagen Production</div>

        
          <div class="p-cite">* Increase in Collagen 1 Levels in NHDF Cells Treated with SKIN LONGEVITY SYSTEM 5.</div>
        
      </div>

      
