      <div class="p-copy">
        <div class="p-pillar-n">Pillar 04</div>

        <h3 class="p-name" style="color: #e67e22;">
          Hydration
        </h3>

        <p class="p-body">Not topical hydration. Biological hydration. The difference between skin that holds moisture because it's producing its own hyaluronic acid, and skin that's borrowing moisture from the air.</p>

        <p class="p-mechanism">High and low molecular weight HA working together. High MW seals the surface. Low MW penetrates deep to signal production. The serum teaches the skin to do what the serum is doing.</p>

        <div class="p-stat" data-value="+254%" style="color: #e67e22;">
  0<sup>*</sup>
</div>

        <div class="p-stat-label">Hyaluronic Acid Production</div>

        
          <div class="p-cite">* Hyaluronan Synthase - 2 Promotion in NHDF Cells After 48-Hour Exposure to SKIN LONGEVITY SYSTEM 5.</div>
        
      </div>

      
    </div>
  
    <div class="pillar sm dark">
      

      <div class="p-copy">
        <div class="p-pillar-n">Pillar 05</div>

        <h3 class="p-name" style="color: #ffffffeb;">
          Defence
        </h3>

        <p class="p-body">Pores are where strain shows up first. When skin is under pressure, from congestion, environment, or daily wear, pore area widens. Bring that strain down and pores visibly tighten. It is one of the clearest signals that skin is coping better.</p>

        <p class="p-mechanism">Marine-derived bioactive compounds help skin handle that daily load. In testing, the measured outcome was pore area, reduced by nearly half.</p>

        <div class="p-stat" data-value="-43%" style="color: #ffffffeb;">
  0<sup>*</sup>
</div>

        <div class="p-stat-label">Pore Area Reduction</div>

        
          <div class="p-cite">* In-Vivo Study Conducted to Test Efficacy of Marine Biotic Factors.</div>
        
      </div>

      
